&lt;li&gt;A critical thinker, with attention to detail and effective organizational skills, who is able to manage diverse data and build effective presentations for product and content leaders with actionable suggestions to improve or influence operational decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, and ability to identify patterns from complex data, produce accurate conclusions, and report critical information or recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally some experience with data manipulation in SQL/Python/R, and Data visualization using Tableau/PowerBI/Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess the ability to multitask and work effectively under time pressure; a willingness to contribute independently; an eagerness to continue learning new skills; and a drive to deliver tangible results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional Excel/Word/PowerPoint/Google Sheets/Google Docs/Google Slides experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
