&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cloud-native development experience with AWS or GCP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Skilled with containerization and orchestration tools (Kubernetes, Docker, Helm).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
