&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of full-stack development projects, from backend APIs (Python/Java) to front-end integration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
